3. **Code Quality**: Added Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.NetAnalyzers for enhanced static code analysis and security scanning

4. **AWS Integration**: Added commented placeholders for AWS SDK packages (to be uncommented when AWS services are actually used in the infrastructure layer)

